[00:00.00][by:Hong_Cat]
[00:31.60] She was dancing, she was smiling
[00:31.60]她翩翩起舞 莞尔一笑
[00:33.19] Roses blooming in her cheeks
[00:33.19]玫瑰在她脸上绽放
[00:35.09] In a quiet kind of litany
[00:35.09]她悄无声息
[00:36.98] She accepted some defeat
[00:36.98]哪怕忍受着失败也绝不动摇
[00:38.83] And then she twirled into the arms
[00:38.83]她寻求着臂膀的宽护
[00:40.54] Of disgrace, and then repelled
[00:40.54]寻求着失败后的慰籍
[00:42.55] Now, she's fallen to her knees
[00:42.55]寻求着失败后的慰籍
[00:44.36] But you couldn't ever tell
[00:44.36]但你可能不为所知
[00:46.35] And then, she asked me how we got here
[00:46.35]她询问着我们如何才能成功
[00:49.29] I told her, "I don't know!"
[00:49.29]我告诉她一切随缘
[00:51.14] And if you keep on asking
[00:51.14]就算你继续盘问
[00:52.92] I'll just keep saying so
[00:52.92]我的回答也不会改变
[00:54.84] This isn't what I wanted
[00:54.84]这不是我想要的
[00:56.73] It isn't what you need
[00:56.73]也不是你所需的
[00:58.61] But let them keep on talking
[00:58.61]就让他人继续芸芸杂谈
[01:00.41] Just calm yourself and breathe
[01:00.41]你只要继续前行就好
[01:03.81] Don't you pay them any mind
[01:03.81]不要再被那些琐事缠身
[01:07.56] Don't you pay them any mind
[01:07.56]不必再为无关的事烦心
[01:11.27] You know this happens every time
[01:11.27]你心知肚明事情向来如此
[01:15.00] Now, don't you pay them any mind
[01:15.00]现在你只要无视一切 继续前行
[01:16.37] Where the burdens of her mother
[01:16.37]她母亲寄予她的厚望
[01:18.04] Weigh like sandbags on the eyes
[01:18.04]重如沙袋 迫在眉睫
[01:19.94] As she closes, just to open
[01:19.94]她只好从中做出选择
[01:21.73] As the sirens whirling by
[01:21.73]是已然放弃 还是咬牙坚持
[01:23.70] And now she's off to tell her secret
[01:23.70]她心中的秘密无从坦然
[01:25.54] To a friend somewhere in town
[01:25.54]只好找镇上的朋友叙述一番
[01:27.50] And her friend just takes a moment
[01:27.50]她的朋友稍加思索
[01:29.37] And asks why I'm not around
[01:29.37]便知道我们的感情破裂
[01:31.26] Darling, this is something
[01:31.26]亲爱的 有些东西
[01:33.17] I should have told you long ago
[01:33.17]我早该告诉你的
[01:34.91] I just want you to feel safe
[01:34.91]但我又怕你没有安全感
[01:36.78] I just want to make you glow
[01:36.78]我只是想让你的人生绽放光彩
[01:38.67] Oh, how you glowed when we were young
[01:38.67]我们年轻时是如此的光彩夺目
[01:40.39] And with nothing on our minds
[01:40.39]脑中所想的一切
[01:42.50] But each other, one another
[01:42.50]都是关乎于彼此
[01:44.31] And we had nothing then but time
[01:44.31]那时的我们拥有青春的资本
[01:46.24] And then, she asked me how we got here
[01:46.24]她询问着我们如何才能成功
[01:49.17] I told her, "I don't know!"
[01:49.17]我告诉她一切随缘
[01:51.08] And if you keep on asking
[01:51.08]就算你继续盘问
[01:52.92] I'll just keep saying so
[01:52.92]我的回答也不会改变
[01:54.87] This isn't what I wanted
[01:54.87]这不是我想要的
[01:56.72] It isn't what you need
[01:56.72]也不是你所需的
[01:58.55] But let them keep on talking
[01:58.55]就让他人继续芸芸杂谈
[02:00.36] Just calm yourself and breathe
[02:00.36]你只要继续前行就好
[02:03.83] Don't you pay them any mind
[02:03.83]不要再被那些琐事缠身
[02:07.40] Don't you pay them any mind
[02:07.40]不必再为无关的事烦心
[02:11.21] You know this happens every time
[02:11.21]你心知肚明事情向来如此
[02:15.02] Now, don't you pay them any mind
[02:15.02]现在你只要无视一切 继续前行
[02:31.26] Some days you hear it (don't listen, honey)
[02:31.26]你时而心领神会（不必烦心）
[02:35.62] Some days you don't (don't listen, oh no)
[02:35.62]时而却一窍不通（不必困扰）
[02:39.46] Sometimes you feel it (it's not worth it, honey)
[02:39.46]有时你能感同身受（这并不关乎对错）
[02:43.14] Sometimes you won't
[02:43.14]但有时太多的顾虑实属多余
